- Use memoization where justified.
- Optimize uploaded images.
- Avoid unnecessarily large application bundles.
- Dynamically import browser-only PDF libraries.
- Prevent browser-only APIs from running during server rendering.
- Validate all imported JSON.
- Sanitize user-generated text before rendering.
- Avoid injecting untrusted HTML.
- Keep user resume data in local browser storage.
- Avoid logging personal resume content to the console.

